{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测 aws 命令带 --endpoint-url。对应需求：云 API 被重定向到非官方端点。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","endgame-*","auditbeat-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux AWS CLI使用自定义endpoint","references":["https://sysdig.com/blog/scarleteel-2-0/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"349276c0-5fcf-11ef-b1a9-f661ea17fbce","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 命令与控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 云凭据滥用"],"type":"new_terms","timestamp_override":"event.ingested","query":"host.os.type:\"linux\" and event.category:\"process\" and\nevent.action:(\"exec\" or \"exec_event\" or \"executed\" or \"process_started\" or \"ProcessRollup2\") and\nprocess.name:\"aws\" and process.args:\"--endpoint-url\"\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n进程名为 aws 且参数含 --endpoint-url。\n\n### 为何重要\n可把请求打到恶意端点，绕过云日志与控制。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 提取自定义 URL 并查信誉。\n2. 核对执行用户与密钥。\n3. 查随后网络与数据外传。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维操作\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1102","name":"Web Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1102/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1102.002","name":"Bidirectional Communication","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1102/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["host.id"],"history_window_start":"now-3d","false_positives":["本地 LocalStack/开发自定义端点","已登记的第三方 AWS 兼容集成"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络事件）。\n2. 确认 `logs-endpoint.events.process*` 有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":8,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
